#36501
A Quiet Journey~
   The path continues, wending its way ribbonlike down the slope of the grassy
hill.  Trees of various types have burst sporadically through the soil to
either side over the centuries, making the sloping terrain resemble a patchwork
quilt of green and brown shades.  Twisted, gnarled things, they loom
menacingly like the foot soldiers of some army of flora.  The cobblestones
shift underfoot occasionally, evidence of insufficient maintenance.    
~
