#36502
The Valley Floor~
   After several hundred yards the path flattens out as it reaches the valley
floor, which houses Gilchrist, nestled between the surrounding hills,
ostensibly secure in their protective earthen embrace.  The hills to either
side bear the other noteworthy landmarks of the valley, and to the north a
junction marks the point where disparate roads rise to meet these destinations.
  
~
