#36503
A Meeting of Paths~
   At this point the valley path is met by another trail, running west towards
the base of the forbidding hill that houses Hillside cemetery, the cursed
resting place of the restless dead.  Since the coming of the Witch and her
curse, none have dared venture any nearer this former site of remembrance and
respect.  Agents of the Necromancer abound in these lands, it would seem.  The
trees near here shift slightly, as if troubled by a breeze, though the air
remains quite still.  A chill tinges the air, enough to warrant an extra cloak,
and the faint stench of death drifts ever so slightly from the west.    
~
