#36506
The Top of Rannu's Tor~
   After a long, exhausting ascent, the path levels out and heads west towards
the gloomy gates of Hillside.  Bleached bones lie scattered to either side,
ample evidence of evil activities both within and without the cemetery.  Those
who have been sent here by the Baron or the towns folk to lay the evil presence
to rest have never returned...    
~
