#36508
The Desecrated Graveyard~
   Twisted, blackened tombstones tear through the tainted soil like the granite
teeth of some gargantuan subterranean beast, gnashing and grinding at the
mangled corpses that stagger from beneath them, all abandoning their resting
places, eager to walk upon the surface once more.  Filled with a dark
malevolence, they stagger among the gaping graves, eager to drink their fill of
the blood of innocents.    
~
