#36522
The Chapel~
   Dark stains, marking the point where wounded victims attempted to scale the
walls to clamber out the broken stained glass windows, cover the once-white
walls, a grim reminder of the unpleasant fate suffered by those whose bodies
litter the chapel.  A thick stench causes constant discomfort, although it is
not as bad here as in the central worship area.  Scrawling and scribbling cover
the walls here scribed in blood by some deranged man.    
~
