#36523
The Chapel~
   The bulk of this wing of the chapel has been filled with bodies, piled high
for some unfathomable purpose.  Most of them are in various stages of decay,
and show signs of having been at least partially devoured over the last few
weeks, as if some beast pauses to nibble every now and again on the protruding
pieces of flesh.  Faces agape in visages of pure terror, these unfortunates
have been damned, their souls taken as easily as their bodies.    
~
