#36526
The Hidden Crypt~
   A narrow, dusty crawl space runs behind the false wall, heading into the
darkness, presumably towards the final resting place of someone of importance.
Why the tomb has been concealed thus far remains a mystery.  Cobwebs fill the
shadowed ceiling, of which very little can be seen.  Several pairs of
footprints in the thick dust covering the floor indicates someone has been here
recently...    
~
