#36527
The Hidden Crypt~
   The passage ends here, at the top of a narrow stair that descends into the
darkness, out of the range of any light source.  A chill fills the air,
accompanied by occasional gusts of wind from somewhere far below.  Moans are
carried on this unnatural breeze, moans of sheer anguish and despair.    
~
