#36529
The Demonic Chantry~
   Long stone passages beckon, rife with the evil infestation that has cast
such a pall over the valley.  Surely one need look no further for ample
evidence of the Necromancer's black hand reaching out over this region.  His
minions abound, pursuing their insane, nihilistic plans to thrust the world
into eternal darkness.  Howls and screams, expected in this fell domain, echo
down the greasy stone halls.    
~
