#36532
The Demonic Chantry~
   A gaping pit lies here, beyond a pentagram where unholy ceremonies have
created a gateway to the inhospitable plane of the hellish ones who rule this
dark cabal.  It would be sheer folly to pass into such a place, where chaos
reigns supreme.  Strange noises come from the pit, as of a beast in tremendous
pain.  Trails of blood run from the dark pentacle into the pit, accompanied by
a slurping sound, as if this ichor were sustaining something...    
~
