#36533
The Pit~
   The soft earthen floor conceals the half-buried remains of a score or more
of victims of the cabal, hurled down here during the unholy rituals to their
dark masters.  The air is cold, and damp, and carries the familiar putrescent
odor common to most of this place.  Something foul lives here, something no
mortal was meant to ever see...    
~
