The Demonic Chantry~
   The passage ends here, in a dead end that boasts but a single stone door,
set in the eastern wall and heavily decorated with murals of scenes common to
the afterlife.  A series of dark glyphs have been superimposed on this mural,
doubtless marks of the cabal, signifying that who (or what) lies beyond this
door is of some importance...    
