#36536
A Dark Sanctuary~
   Once a tomb of an ancient knight, the contents of this chamber have been
cast out, and replaced with a long desk, laden with piles of parchment covered
in black runes and sigils.  A dull humming sound arises from them, accompanied
by the occasional low moan.  The air is thick with the stench of brimstone, and
the blood that forms the pentagram on the floor seethes and bubbles, as if it
were boiling.  The naked corpse of an unfortunate villager lies drained of
blood in one corner.  This is obviously the chambers of the cabal's leader.  
But where is the Witch?  Or her master, the Necromancer?    
~
