#36584
The Treasure Vault~
   A fabulous amount of wealth greets your jaded eyes as you wrench open the
trapdoor and drop down into this tiny chamber.  Statues carved by artisans of
civilizations lost centuries ago line wooden shelves, while crates and chests
overflowing with priceless gems and jewels cover the floor.  You don't even
notice as the trapdoor swings slowly shut above you, nor do you notice as the
air grows thinner, until you suddenly begin to choke while examining a matched
pair of Lifebanes, your vision blurring as you sink into a sleep you will never
awaken from.  Imps scurry over your body, stripping it of valuables, which they
deposit on the shelves, then they return to their niches, awaiting the next
intruder...    
~
