made of some amorphous substance, namely stone colored flesh.  A vile smell
assaults your nostrils, an unmistakable odor of death and decay.  Even the
darkest soul would find it hard to continue; not out of disgust, but out of
fear and respect for the terrible master of a domain as foul as this.  Surely
nothing mortal could subsist in such a place?    
~
